  "updated_at": "2026-10-28T06:53:51.000Z",
  "body": "**国产卡线：Ascend 910B 算子优化与 HG-KDA 工作流完善**\n\n会议指定10个算子已完成复测与诊断：**7项默认条件达标，1项在官方确定性条件下达标，2项完成补充NPU对照，参考CPU回退问题单列。** 达标线为完整正确性通过、相对参考加速比超过0.8×。\n\n\n\n**FlagGems 算子：**\n\n| 算子 | Excel原记录 | FlagGems实测 | HG-KDA | 完整评测 | 关键优化 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `value_selecting_reduction_backward` | 0.4935× | 0.759× | **1.635×** | 96/96 | 优化梯度回填，修复非连续布局处理 |\n| `scatter_add` | 精度失败 | 0.258×；扩展测试失败 | **1.900×** | 18/18＋补充测试 | 优化散射累加，补齐数值与非连续布局处理 |\n| `uniform` | 精度通过，无有效加速比 | 0.141×；扩展测试失败 | **1.325×** | 18/18＋随机状态检查 | 修复随机数整数运算，优化状态读取与启动 |\n| `rad2deg_` | 精度失败 | 正确性失败 | **1.117×** | 36/36＋18项补充 | 修复原地计算语义，调整分块、减少启动开销 |\n| `upsample_bilinear2d` | 精度失败 | 编译／布局失败 | **0.915×** | 24/24＋84项补充 | 优化插值实现，修复布局处理，确保输出写入无冲突 |\n| `log10_` | 精度失败 | 正确性失败 | **0.875×** | 36/36＋63项补充 | 修复特殊值处理，优化缓冲和数据搬运 |\n| `selu_` | 精度失败 | 0.119× | **0.837×** | 36/36＋63项补充 | 调整分块与数据处理方式，减少启动开销 |\n| `cumulative_trapezoid` | 精度失败 | 0.363×；默认扩展测试失败 | **0.812×，确定性条件** | 33/33 | 保留已验证实现；定位默认参考重复运行的数值不稳定问题 |\n| `fractional_max_pool3d` | 0.0266× | 正式通过，扩展测试部分失败；参考CPU回退 | **10.066×，补充NPU对照** | 两组各9/9＋57项补充 | 连续输出分块，较已有实现实际加速 **1.547×** |\n| `_conj_physical` | 精度失败 | 正确性失败；参考CPU回退 | **2.296×，补充NPU对照** | 两组各14/14＋34项补充 | 保留已有Triton实现，补齐参考执行路径与布局验证 |\n\n\n前7项均相对默认PyTorch参考计分。最后两项使用**自建的多原语NPU分解参考**进行补充对照，不能直接等同于相对官方原生NPU算子的加速。\n\n\n\n**FlagGems-SGLang 算子（沿用已交付结果）：**\n\n| 算子 | FlagGems-SGLang实测 | HG-KDA | 完整评测 | 关键优化 |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `gelu_and_mul` | 0.068× | **2.271×** | 19/19 | 对齐本机GELU公式，连续二维分块，简化索引与启动 |\n| `moe_sum_reduce` | 0.965× | **1.624×** | 24/24 | 优化融合归约，修复非连续布局处理 |\n\n\n**HG-KDA 工作流完善：** 在成对profiling分析基础上，补充底层算子支持检查、CPU回退识别、参考数值稳定性验证和源码／IR核验，将诊断经验固化到知识库与脚本。源码、复现入口及原始证据已完成三端同步，96项证据检查通过。\n\n\n\n\n\n**新增的热点筛选函数**，位于 [hgkda_adapter.py 的 ](E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24)`[instruction_hotspots](E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24)`[ (line 24)](E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24)。原始指令清单和源码映射由 KGS／厂商工具提供，我们负责**匹配候选 kernel、排除无关任务、按耗时筛选热点**。\n\n真实例子是 `rad2deg_`：报告有92条指令，其中72条带源码映射。脚本筛选出了：\n\n| 热点指令 | 模拟器报告时间 | 对应代码／含义 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| `BAR` | 25.61 μs | 流水同步屏障 |\n| `WAIT_FLAG` | 17.03 μs | 映射到 `tl.store(x_ptr + off, y)`   ，涉及写回相关等待 |\n| `MOV_SRC_TO_DST_ALIGN` | 8.57 μs | 同样对应 `tl.store`   ，执行UB到外部存储的搬运 |\n\n\n这些结果让分析重点落到**写回和流水同步**，再由模型结合源码判断是否值得改变分块或缓冲组织。这里是模拟器指令时间，各项可能重叠。\n\n\n\n四部分可以按“方法＋实例”这样汇报：\n\n| 总工程模块 | 我们的方法 | 已有真实例子 |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| **性能分析** | 同输入成对profiling，脚本比较搬运量、指令数、流水时间、等待与冲突，再结合源码提出改法 | `log10_`   大输入：读取量相近，但候选MTE2指令 **2036条，参考760条**；平均每条搬运约 **16.5 KB，参考44.2 KB**。据此优先检查搬运粒度与分块 |\n| **热点指令筛选** | 匹配候选kernel，按指令报告时间排序，保留源码映射，交给模型分析具体机制 | `rad2deg_`   ：从92条指令中筛出 `BAR`   、`WAIT_FLAG`   和搬运热点，并关联到计算、写回代码 |\n| **分层知识库** | 将成功方法、失败经验和适用条件，按“算子类型＋性能指标”分类，供后续分析角色复用 | 将 `selu_`   的经验固化为：**小输入查启动，大输入查分块；扩大分块前检查UB容量**。同时记录FP16可行的配置不能直接套给BF16／FP32 |\n| **评测与反馈** | KGS完整评测之外，增加布局、特殊值、别名、stream等检查；失败反馈用于修复和重新选版 | `upsample_bilinear2d`   ：发现并修复分块重复写入，最终 **24/24正式测试＋84项补充检查通过**，相对PyTorch **0.915×** |\n\n\n成对profiling是在导师方法基础上完成的910B适配与接入；热点筛选、分类知识和补充验证构成我们的工程贡献。\n\n\n\n**我们将优化过程固化为“成对比较找差异、热点指令查机制、分类知识选方法、完整评测验效果”的工作流。脚本负责整理证据，Agent结合源码提出修改，验证后的方法与失败经验再沉淀到知识库。**\n\n",
  "body_html": "<!doctype html><div class=\"lake-content\" typography=\"classic\"><p id=\"u819cc9bb\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">国产卡线：Ascend 910B 算子优化与 HG-KDA 工作流完善</span></strong></p><p id=\"ufda3d5a3\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">会议指定10个算子已完成复测与诊断：</span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">7项默认条件达标，1项在官方确定性条件下达标，2项完成补充NPU对照，参考CPU回退问题单列。</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\"> 达标线为完整正确性通过、相对参考加速比超过0.8×。</span></p><p id=\"u8edf9fbb\" class=\"ne-p\"><br></p><p id=\"u81b71553\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">FlagGems 算子：</span></strong></p><table id=\"OQ9Ke\" class=\"ne-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u34ee7d08\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">算子</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u51a04116\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">Excel原记录</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ue5a84980\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">FlagGems实测</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u6a6c7e26\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">HG-KDA</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u3676b65c\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">完整评测</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uc1cc33ff\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">关键优化</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u4dfe4ddd\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">value_selecting_reduction_backward</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uaa3fb786\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.4935×</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ubbcfe81a\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.759×</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u60032a4e\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">1.635×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ua2bc7e2b\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">96/96</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uaf328f58\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">优化梯度回填，修复非连续布局处理</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ua4e977ef\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">scatter_add</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u05605e34\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uf729c791\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.258×；扩展测试失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ufa7b23f8\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">1.900×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u0e3b5f5f\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">18/18＋补充测试</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u32ee0c74\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">优化散射累加，补齐数值与非连续布局处理</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uaa535649\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">uniform</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u69c65eac\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度通过，无有效加速比</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u4e8d8b13\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.141×；扩展测试失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u50cc17dd\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">1.325×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ud6b1369e\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">18/18＋随机状态检查</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u6080f0b2\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">修复随机数整数运算，优化状态读取与启动</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u0cea2545\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">rad2deg_</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u4e7de8d5\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u65f85f6c\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">正确性失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ue3b24aed\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">1.117×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u1c03a654\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">36/36＋18项补充</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ubed285da\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">修复原地计算语义，调整分块、减少启动开销</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u1fc6b67a\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">upsample_bilinear2d</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uefd863d1\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u8f6f603c\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">编译／布局失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uce7d938c\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">0.915×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ud41e7090\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">24/24＋84项补充</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u91b8f389\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">优化插值实现，修复布局处理，确保输出写入无冲突</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u34623d7b\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">log10_</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u9edb6db6\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ue22adbe5\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">正确性失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u1dc048fb\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">0.875×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u04e9a8d6\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">36/36＋63项补充</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ub7619c82\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">修复特殊值处理，优化缓冲和数据搬运</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u92d31beb\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">selu_</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ufc2eeaa9\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u342b4a48\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.119×</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u9cfed21d\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">0.837×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u5ac03259\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">36/36＋63项补充</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u90c27194\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">调整分块与数据处理方式，减少启动开销</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uc685d460\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">cumulative_trapezoid</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ub1a3deaa\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u84eb809f\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.363×；默认扩展测试失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u61e0aef1\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">0.812×，确定性条件</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ufa169c0c\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">33/33</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u2f9d412d\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">保留已验证实现；定位默认参考重复运行的数值不稳定问题</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u0ea98f40\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">fractional_max_pool3d</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u8818cb2b\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.0266×</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u240e3843\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">正式通过，扩展测试部分失败；参考CPU回退</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u88823028\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">10.066×，补充NPU对照</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"ue2d462e4\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">两组各9/9＋57项补充</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uf085dfdb\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">连续输出分块，较已有实现实际加速 </span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">1.547×</span></strong></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u0d366e5b\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">_conj_physical</span></code></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u82dfd20e\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">精度失败</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u2ad31e1e\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">正确性失败；参考CPU回退</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u9988d000\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">2.296×，补充NPU对照</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"uac6fb0b5\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">两组各14/14＋34项补充</span></p></td><td width=\"125\"><p id=\"u3e448f1c\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">保留已有Triton实现，补齐参考执行路径与布局验证</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"u4da30e88\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">前7项均相对默认PyTorch参考计分。最后两项使用</span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">自建的多原语NPU分解参考</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">进行补充对照，不能直接等同于相对官方原生NPU算子的加速。</span></p><p id=\"u82ee159d\" class=\"ne-p\"><br></p><p id=\"u366b9fa1\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">FlagGems-SGLang 算子（沿用已交付结果）：</span></strong></p><table id=\"oDu3I\" class=\"ne-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"ue4e7bab9\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">算子</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u4cb6aa9f\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">FlagGems-SGLang实测</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u1006ff20\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">HG-KDA</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u9c76af34\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">完整评测</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u41370728\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">关键优化</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u27217101\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">gelu_and_mul</span></code></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u3cadfd5b\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.068×</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u32bd1c3d\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">2.271×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"ucc4bdc0a\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">19/19</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"ubb9d255b\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">对齐本机GELU公式，连续二维分块，简化索引与启动</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u9841758e\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">moe_sum_reduce</span></code></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"ud21d2a40\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">0.965×</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u3d0ff671\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">1.624×</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u956a13c3\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">24/24</span></p></td><td width=\"150\"><p id=\"u8ca64fac\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">优化融合归约，修复非连续布局处理</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"uf25f18ff\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">HG-KDA 工作流完善：</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\"> 在成对profiling分析基础上，补充底层算子支持检查、CPU回退识别、参考数值稳定性验证和源码／IR核验，将诊断经验固化到知识库与脚本。源码、复现入口及原始证据已完成三端同步，96项证据检查通过。</span></p><p id=\"ud6588bad\" class=\"ne-p\"><br></p><p id=\"u7fea6fa8\" class=\"ne-p\"><br></p><p id=\"u01652c32\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">新增的热点筛选函数</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">，位于 </span><a href=\"E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24\" data-href=\"E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ne-link\"><span class=\"ne-text\">hgkda_adapter.py 的 </span></a><code class=\"ne-code\"><a href=\"E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24\" data-href=\"E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ne-link\"><span class=\"ne-text\">instruction_hotspots</span></a></code><a href=\"E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24\" data-href=\"E:/0_XSAI/00_KernelAgent/kernelgen/Ascend-Optimization/project/Ascend-Optimization-v1/tools/profiling/hgkda_adapter.py:24\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"ne-link\"><span class=\"ne-text\"> (line 24)</span></a><span class=\"ne-text\">。原始指令清单和源码映射由 KGS／厂商工具提供，我们负责</span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">匹配候选 kernel、排除无关任务、按耗时筛选热点</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">。</span></p><p id=\"u923635d6\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">真实例子是 </span><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">rad2deg_</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\">：报告有92条指令，其中72条带源码映射。脚本筛选出了：</span></p><table id=\"SU4Uf\" class=\"ne-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u9ca0eecc\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">热点指令</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u94c9a318\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">模拟器报告时间</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"ua5582042\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">对应代码／含义</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u837badf9\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">BAR</span></code></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u5bd0f8d6\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">25.61 μs</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"uef58ed6e\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">流水同步屏障</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"ue7ca899c\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">WAIT_FLAG</span></code></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u67bf84b5\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">17.03 μs</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u7352785f\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">映射到 </span><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">tl.store(x_ptr + off, y)</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">，涉及写回相关等待</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u4ce33f9d\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">MOV_SRC_TO_DST_ALIGN</span></code></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u4582c75d\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">8.57 μs</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u288959db\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">同样对应 </span><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">tl.store</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">，执行UB到外部存储的搬运</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"u015cccec\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">这些结果让分析重点落到</span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">写回和流水同步</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">，再由模型结合源码判断是否值得改变分块或缓冲组织。这里是模拟器指令时间，各项可能重叠。</span></p><p id=\"ud1b1f889\" class=\"ne-p\"><br></p><p id=\"u1aa5da1f\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">四部分可以按“方法＋实例”这样汇报：</span></p><table id=\"ui9e0\" class=\"ne-table\" style=\"width: 750px\"><tbody><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u64635ddc\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">总工程模块</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u6384dbd4\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">我们的方法</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u6b600afc\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">已有真实例子</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u809f5d1b\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">性能分析</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u3a0f892b\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">同输入成对profiling，脚本比较搬运量、指令数、流水时间、等待与冲突，再结合源码提出改法</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"ucef88436\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">log10_</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">大输入：读取量相近，但候选MTE2指令 </span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">2036条，参考760条</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">；平均每条搬运约 </span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">16.5 KB，参考44.2 KB</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">。据此优先检查搬运粒度与分块</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u4ef1b5b3\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">热点指令筛选</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u35f1e930\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">匹配候选kernel，按指令报告时间排序，保留源码映射，交给模型分析具体机制</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"uddab91a0\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">rad2deg_</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">：从92条指令中筛出 </span><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">BAR</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">、</span><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">WAIT_FLAG</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">和搬运热点，并关联到计算、写回代码</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"uc3900f46\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">分层知识库</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u1fd0424f\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">将成功方法、失败经验和适用条件，按“算子类型＋性能指标”分类，供后续分析角色复用</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u9ba773eb\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">将 </span><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">selu_</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">的经验固化为：</span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">小输入查启动，大输入查分块；扩大分块前检查UB容量</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">。同时记录FP16可行的配置不能直接套给BF16／FP32</span></p></td></tr><tr style=\"height: 33px\"><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u987f5c72\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">评测与反馈</span></strong></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u5ebed22e\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">KGS完整评测之外，增加布局、特殊值、别名、stream等检查；失败反馈用于修复和重新选版</span></p></td><td width=\"250\"><p id=\"u54defd3d\" class=\"ne-p\"><code class=\"ne-code\"><span class=\"ne-text\">upsample_bilinear2d</span></code><span class=\"ne-text\"><br /></span><span class=\"ne-text\">：发现并修复分块重复写入，最终 </span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">24/24正式测试＋84项补充检查通过</span></strong><span class=\"ne-text\">，相对PyTorch </span><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">0.915×</span></strong></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p id=\"u521c9ea0\" class=\"ne-p\"><span class=\"ne-text\">成对profiling是在导师方法基础上完成的910B适配与接入；热点筛选、分类知识和补充验证构成我们的工程贡献。</span></p><p id=\"u74d2f80b\" class=\"ne-p\"><br></p><p id=\"u4bfb0563\" class=\"ne-p\"><strong><span class=\"ne-text\">我们将优化过程固化为“成对比较找差异、热点指令查机制、分类知识选方法、完整评测验效果”的工作流。脚本负责整理证据，Agent结合源码提出修改，验证后的方法与失败经验再沉淀到知识库。</span></strong></p></div>",
  "description": "国产卡线：Ascend 910B 算子优化与 HG-KDA 工作流完善会议指定10个算子已完成复测与诊断：7项默认条件达标，1项在官方确定性条件下达标，2项完成补充NPU对照，参考CPU回退问题单列。 达标线为完整正确性通过、相对参考加速比超过0.8×。FlagGems 算子：算子Excel原..."
}
